// chain: the two halves of each stone that touch a neighbour match, and the
// two halves that have no neighbour (the ends of the chain) match each other.
//
// It returns the ordered chain and true if a valid chain exists, or nil and
// false otherwise.
func MakeChain(input []Domino) ([]Domino, bool) {
